# GitNexus auto-filters some directory names as build artifacts. `output` is
# one of them, which silently excluded internal/cli/output/ — a real source
# package (the `toolkit get` renderers) — from the graph: 0 nodes indexed even
# on `analyze --force`. Negate it so the package is indexed.
#
# Verify after changing this:
#   npx gitnexus cypher -r toolkit \
#     "MATCH (n) WHERE n.filePath STARTS WITH 'internal/cli/output' RETURN count(n)"
!internal/cli/output/
